# Critic Feedback Loop

Before making any changes to `train.py` or `smoke_test.py`, read `sessions/critic_notes.md`.

If that file contains unresolved items (marked `[ ]`), address them as part of your changes or explicitly explain why you are skipping one.

After completing your changes, do not edit `sessions/critic_notes.md` yourself — the Critic maintains it.
